\title{Seventh Sunday after Pentecost 2026}
\tag{cmc}
\date{2026-07-12}
\author{liamoc}
\quote{
Omnes gentes, pláudite mánibus, iubiláte Deo in voce exsultatiónis. Quóniam Dóminus excélsus, terríbilis: Rex mangus super omnem terram.
}
\p{Today we were in light numbers at [All Saints Ainslie](https://allsaintsainslie.org.au) but still pulled off a solid performance of How's [Day by Day](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ro16TEogDG4)}
\quote{
  \poem{
    \line{Day by day, dear Lord,}
\line{of thee three things I pray;}
\line{to see thee more clearly,}
\line{to love thee more dearly,}
\line{to follow thee more nearly,}
\line{day by day.}
}
}
\p{This service included the baptism of many children all from the same family, so it was a rather special service in that respect. Later in the month we will have a confirmation service with fourteen (14!) confirmees, which is a promising sign for the health of the parish.}
